  "description": "HTML to PDF and PNG conversion built for heavy legacy .NET Framework apps (4.6.2–4.8.1: ASP.NET MVC 5, Web Forms, WCF, Windows Services) as well as modern .NET (.NET 10, plus .NET Core 2.0+ and .NET 5-9 through .NET Standard 2.0). Modern Playwright Chromium rendering without upgrading your runtime. Works without DI; optional queue, background worker and DI helpers included. Report issues at https://github.com/rubiconmp/public-issues",
  "id": "Rmp.DocProc.HtmlToPdf",
  "isPrerelease": false,
